OL,3,GNEWSAMan due in court on attempted
OL,4,Amurder charge
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 43-year-old man has been charged with
OL,7,Fattempted murder after a man in his 70s
OL,8,Fwas found with serious injuries.
OL,10,FDaniel Kent, of Broad Lane, Sutterton,
OL,11,Fnear Boston, is due to appear at
OL,12,FLincoln Magistrates' Court on
OL,13,FWednesday.
OL,15,FLincolnshire Police was called to
OL,16,FKirkby on Bain, near Horncastle, on
OL,17,FSaturday.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
